                  "id": "p-maintenance-helps-3",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Even small components, like brake chambers, suspension bushings, lights, and air lines, affect overall performance. Using low-quality parts can lead to repeated issues or costly out-of-service events. High-quality parts reduce those risks and keep your fleet running the way it should.",
